# [mailhog]
# The host ports MailHog publishes, defaults live in this plugin's .env - the web UI
# (http://localhost:8025) and SMTP (1025, for senders outside the my-sites-ide network,
# e.g. minikube). Sites in the IDE always use mailhog:1025, whatever these are set to.
# Run `php my-sites-ide mail:mailhog-start` after changing either.
#MAILHOG_UI_PORT=8025
#MAILHOG_SMTP_PORT=1025
